# {{ project_name }}

{{ description }}

{% if connector_category == "datasource" %}
This is a **datasource connector** that indexes documents and content into [Glean](https://www.glean.com/) using the `glean-indexing-sdk`.
{% else %}
This is a **people connector** that indexes employee/people data into [Glean](https://www.glean.com/) using the `glean-indexing-sdk`.
{% endif %}

## Prerequisites

- [Python](https://www.python.org/) {{ python_version }}+
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (for dependency management and running scripts)

## Setup

1. Install dependencies:

   ```bash
   uv sync
   ```

2. Copy the environment template and fill in your credentials:

   ```bash
   cp env.template .env
   ```

3. Open `.env` and provide the required values:

   - `GLEAN_INSTANCE` -- your Glean instance name (e.g. `my-company` for `my-company.glean.com`)
   - `GLEAN_INDEXING_API_TOKEN` -- an indexing API token generated from your Glean admin console

## Usage

Run the connector:

```bash
uv run {{ project_name }}
```

Or equivalently:

```bash
uv run python -m {{ module_name }}
```

## Testing

Run the test suite:

```bash
uv run pytest
```

Run with coverage reporting:

```bash
uv run pytest --cov --cov-report=term-missing
```

Lint and format checks:

```bash
uv run ruff check src/ tests/
uv run ruff format --check src/ tests/
```

Type checking:

```bash
uv run pyright
```

